tion on product creation\", \"actual\": \"Created a product with only Name and Short Description filled (no image URL, no affiliate/retailer link, no full review, no specifications, price left at default $0). The admin form accepted and saved it without any validation error, and the product immediately became publicly visible on /products (\\\"Incomplete Test Product\\\", $0), violating the requirement that a product cannot be published until it has all required content.\", \"evidence\": null}, {\"item_id\": \"CS-22\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"/product/nonexistent-product-xyz shows \\\"Product Not Found\\\" heading with clear message and \\\"Browse All Products\\\" link, no product data leaked. /category/nonexistent-category shows \\\"Category Not Found\\\" heading with clear message, no product grid or unrelated data shown.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"IX-13\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Changing category filter dropdown and search box updated products.grid and products.count immediately in the same page render without any reload (e.g. \\\"All Categories\\\"->\\\"Home Goods\\\" changed count from 10 to 3 instantly).\"}, {\"item_id\": \"IX-14\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Clicking a product card's image/name link (e.g. products.grid.item.qa-test-gadget, philips-hue-starter-kit-v2) navigated to /product/<same-slug> each time, matching the clicked product's detail page.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"IX-15\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Each product's \\\"Buy Now\\\" link points to an external retailer URL (e.g. https://example.com/sony-xm5, https://retailer.example.com/buy/qa-fitness), distinct from the app's own domain, confirmed via product cards and detail pages.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"IX-21\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Using the category filter select o